sequenceDiagram
    participant DAG as Airflow DAG
    participant S3C as S3 Curated Zone<br/>ods-curated-{env}
    participant GLUE as Glue Job<br/>ods-s3-publish-{dataset}
    participant PG as PostgreSQL<br/>pipeline.glue_job_log
    participant SR as Glue Schema Registry<br/>ods-schema-registry-{env}
    participant GDQ as Glue Data Quality<br/>ods-dq-results-{env}
    participant KAFKA as MSK Topic<br/>ods.{domain}.{dataset}
    participant DLQ as S3 DLQ<br/>ods-dlq-{env}

    DAG->>GLUE: Trigger (config ref + pinned S3 version ID)
    GLUE->>S3C: Read Parquet file (source path from config)
    S3C-->>GLUE: Parquet data + row count (e.g. 10,000 rows)
    GLUE->>GLUE: Extract business_date from filename
    GLUE->>PG: INSERT status=started (run_id · job_name · source_path · business_date)

    Note over GLUE,SR: Phase 1 — Schema Validation
    GLUE->>SR: Fetch schema (pinned schema ID from config)
    SR-->>GLUE: Schema + compatibility rules
    GLUE->>GLUE: Validate incoming Parquet schema
    alt Compatible schema change detected
        GLUE->>SR: Auto-register new schema version
        SR-->>GLUE: New version confirmed
    else Incompatible — breaking change
        GLUE->>PG: INSERT status=failed (error_reason=schema_incompatible · error_detail)
        GLUE->>DLQ: Route file to DLQ with reason
        GLUE-->>DAG: Job failed (schema)
    end
    GLUE->>PG: INSERT status=schema_validated (schema_version)

    Note over GLUE,GDQ: Phase 2 — Data Quality
    GLUE->>GDQ: Run DQDL rules (completeness, uniqueness, ranges)
    alt Dataset-level hard block fails (e.g. RowCount)
        GLUE->>PG: INSERT status=failed (error_reason=dq_dataset_block · error_detail)
        GLUE->>DLQ: Route file to DLQ with reason
        GLUE-->>DAG: Job failed (data quality)
    else Row-level hard block — some rows fail
        GDQ-->>GLUE: Row outcomes (passed + failed rows)
        GLUE->>DLQ: Write failed rows (partitioned: date/topic/run_id)
        GLUE->>PG: INSERT status=dq_warned (record_count · failed_row_count · rule_name)
        Note over GLUE: Passed rows continue to Phase 3
    else Soft warn only
        GDQ-->>GLUE: Warnings (field, threshold, actual)
        GLUE->>PG: INSERT status=dq_warned (rule_name · warning_detail)
    else All rules passed
        GLUE->>PG: INSERT status=dq_passed (record_count)
    end

    Note over GLUE,KAFKA: Phase 3 — Publish
    GLUE->>GLUE: Generate deterministic message keys (hash of key fields)
    GLUE->>PG: INSERT status=publishing (record_count · target_topic)
    GLUE->>KAFKA: Publish records (Kafka transactions · acks=all · exactly-once)
    GLUE->>GLUE: Verify published count == source count
    alt Count mismatch
        GLUE->>PG: INSERT status=failed (error_reason=count_mismatch · expected · actual)
        GLUE->>DLQ: Write undelivered records
        GLUE-->>DAG: Job failed (count mismatch)
    else Count verified
        GLUE->>PG: INSERT status=completed (record_count · target_topic · business_date)
        GLUE-->>DAG: Job completed successfully
    end
